OG_TRIP_CLEAR" (at 223.51999999999998 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d5d8946a-cf39-59e3-b241-a72fffea025d")) (wire (pts (xy 223.51999999999998 134.62) (xy 223.51999999999998 139.7)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "0646e052-7efd-518a-ada4-2b5b04de963e")) (label "LOGIC_GND" (at 223.51999999999998 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "13a9f17d-06c8-55b4-9eeb-2925f06360e7")) (text "SAME 3.3V LOGIC DOMAIN / DELIBERATE REARM AND ACTIVE-HIGH CLEAR REQUEST\nOPI_REARM_M and WATCHDOG_TRIP_CLEAR default LOW. FPGA unconfigured GPIO must be high-impedance.\nClear request drives U4018 inverter INPUTS WD_REARM_M/O. U4019 owns the active-low latch-clear OUTPUTS.\nSeparate receiving nets and power-reset qualification remain. No automatic restart or healthy bypass.\nGateware, GPIO startup pulls, IOZ at intermediate supplies and loaded response remain qualification gates." (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f1afe6b3-18ce-5092-882c-13434e66412c")))
